hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nek khatun Khaulah bint Hakim, jo Usman bin Maz'un (Raziyallahu anhum) ki biwi thin, ne bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hasan aur Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke sath bahar tashreef laye, phir farmaya: '[Aulad] bakheel aur buzdil banane wali [hai].' Aur ek aur martaba unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue dekha: 'Aur beshak tum zaroor [bakheel ban jate ho].'"
"17","[AI-translation] Khaulah [bint Hakim] se, jo Usman bin Maz'un (Raziyallahu anhum) ki biwi thin: Main ne unhen kehte hue suna — murad Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hain: 'Beshak tumhare Rabb ka aakhri qadam [jo us ne rakha] Wajj [Taif ki wadi] mein hai.'"
